Z||000000||theogre||09-13-2001||08:46 PM||||<A HREF="http://www.news.com/" TARGET=_blank>Cnet news</A> is reporting that several scams are already circulating regarding the WTC bombing and dontating to Red Cross and other disaster funds. <A HREF="http://news.cnet.com/news/0-1005-200-7150774.html?tag=mn_hd" TARGET=_blank>http://news.cnet.com/news/0-1005-200-7150774.html?tag=mn_hd</A> <P>DO NOT donate funds thru links recieved via E-mail! DO NOT forward e-mail with such links!<P>Instead you can use direct www sites and toll free numbers provided by the organizations. Amazon.com and other legitimate internet retailers have also setup links to donate to the various organizations. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 09-13-2001).]||||reg||4
